"""Semantic mutants for tools/validate.py.

Each entry is (label, file, search, replace). The search text must occur
exactly once in the named source file; the replacement must keep the program
type-correct so that the mutant compiles and runs. A mutant only counts as
rejected when the mutated binary builds, runs to completion and then prints an
answer that differs from the independent oracle: a compile error or a crash is
recorded as a failure of the mutation test, never as a detection.
"""
